  "properties": {
    "title": "French Polynesia administrative and jurisdictional boundaries (long table)",
    "description": "All boundary levels for French Polynesia, from the EEZ to the finest published level, stacked in one table (one row per unit per level). Sources: Section Cadastre-Topographie de la Polynesie francaise (Direction des affaires foncieres, DAF), \"Geographie administrative de la Polynesie francaise (communes et communes associees, iles, groupements)\" (pyf-daf-geographie-administrative-2022); Institut de la statistique de la Polynesie francaise (ISPF), \"Limites geographiques administratives (Communes, Communes associees, Iles, Quartiers 2000)\" (pyf-ispf-limites-administratives-2022); Pacific Community (SPC), Geoscience, Energy and Maritime Division, \"Global Exclusive Economic Zones (200 Nautical Miles) - Merged Dataset (SPC Pacific Maritime Boundaries)\" (spc-gem-pacific-eez-200nm). Licences (per row in the `license` column): CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0, CC-BY-4.0, ODbL-1.0. Some rows are used and redistributed by this project under a data-use agreement (CSDR-SPC data use agreement (user-confirmed 2026-11-20)); downstream users are bound by the row's public licence (e.g. CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) unless they hold their own agreement. Full provenance and source notes: https://github.com/SustainableDevelopmentReform/pacific-administrative-boundaries/blob/v0.1.0/docs/sources.md#pyf-french-polynesia.",
